        <span>2026 全网网络节点性能实测看板已更新</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        2026 稳定机场推荐与 <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-600 via-emerald-600 to-cyan-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          科学上网梯子选购
        </span> 深度评测指南
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-6 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        拒绝虚假无脑软文，云机场 (<strong class="text-slate-900 font-mono font-semibold">yunjichang.vip</strong>) 依托海外高防探针集群，对主流机场进行 7×24 小时晚高峰真实带宽压测与延迟监控，为你筛选真正稳定不跑路的 IPLC 专线服务。
      </p>

      <!-- Key Metrics Strip -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-10">
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm">
          <div class="text-2xl font-black text-teal-600 font-mono">100%</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5">真实晚高峰带载压测</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm">
          <div class="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-600 font-mono">&lt; 40ms</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5">IPLC 专线优质平均延迟</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm">
          <div class="text-2xl font-black text-cyan-600 font-mono">4K/8K</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5">流媒体原生住宅解锁率</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm">
          <div class="text-2xl font-black text-amber-600 font-mono">0 元</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5">商业恰饭虚假排名</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Action Buttons -->
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
